From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] avformat/isom_tags: dav1, the AV1 Dolby Vision sample entry

MP4 files with AV1-based Dolby Vision can carry their video under the
dav1 sample entry. FFmpeg 9.0.2 does not know the tag, so it does not
find the codec; map it to AV1, next to av01. The tag has since been
added to FFmpeg upstream: drop this patch when the packaged FFmpeg has
it.

Origin: the native-dv Kodi port (yblod-engine).

Regrouped from ffmpeg-9900-01-libavformat__isom_tags.c (YBLOD 0.2 to
0.4.1); no code change.
---
 libavformat/isom_tags.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/libavformat/isom_tags.c b/libavformat/isom_tags.c
index c0c239d39348..e1789cf63f12 100644
--- a/libavformat/isom_tags.c
+++ b/libavformat/isom_tags.c
@@ -155,6 +155,7 @@ const AVCodecTag ff_codec_movvideo_tags[] = {
     { AV_CODEC_ID_VP8,  MKTAG('v', 'p', '0', '8') }, /* VP8 */
     { AV_CODEC_ID_VP9,  MKTAG('v', 'p', '0', '9') }, /* VP9 */
     { AV_CODEC_ID_AV1,  MKTAG('a', 'v', '0', '1') }, /* AV1 */
+    { AV_CODEC_ID_AV1,  MKTAG('d', 'a', 'v', '1') }, /* AV1-based Dolby Vision */
 
     { AV_CODEC_ID_MPEG1VIDEO, MKTAG('m', '1', 'v', ' ') },
     { AV_CODEC_ID_MPEG1VIDEO, MKTAG('m', '1', 'v', '1') }, /* Apple MPEG-1 Camcorder */
